                    Introductioî tï STARFALL

INTRODUCTION‚ 

    Witè  thå advenô oæ fasteò thaî lighô travel¬  thå peoplå  oæ 
thå  eartè havå founä relieæ froí thå pressureó oæ overpopulatioî 
anä  depletioî  oæ naturaì  resources®   Thousandó  oæ  automatiã 
probeó  havå  beeî senô  tï thå mosô promisinç staò  systems¬  iî 
hopeó  oæ findinç habitablå planets.

    Oî  Earth¬  carefullù selecteä teamó arå traineä tï  colonizå     
theså  planets¬  explorinç  anä preparinç theí  foò  thå  teeminç 
millionó  whï  wilì follow®   Iî ordeò tï ensurå  success¬  everù 
colonisô  musô havå á workinç knowledgå oæ geology¬  mining¬  anä 
agriculture®   Thå  directoró  oæ  theså  teamó  arå  hand-pickeä 
specialists®   Theù musô bå ablå tï coordinatå thå effortó oæ thå 
foundlinç colonù iî growinç food¬ buildinç shelter¬ anä explorinç 
thå vasô reacheó oæ theiò ne÷ home.

    Aó  onå  oæ thå memberó oæ thió elitå  group¬  yoõ  anä  youò 
personallù choseî teaí oæ engineers¬  technicians¬  anä colonistó 
havå  beeî assigneä tï á newlù discovereä planet®   Yoõ havå onlù 
thå mapó madå bù thå roboô probes¬ thå equipmenô yoõ requisition¬ 
anä  youò poweró oæ judgemenô tï aiä you®   Yoõ colonù  maù  gro÷ 
intï á statå thaô rivaló motheò Earth¬ oò iô maù bå remembereä aó 
onå  oæ thå greaô disasteró oæ alì time®   Iô dependó oî ho÷ welì 
yoõ caî allocatå youò manpower¬  equipment¬ anä naturaì resourceó 
tï thå taskó yoõ musô perform.
