                            CHAPTER 6


                       Warnings and Hints

    Thå   followinç  ió simplù á compilatioî oæ somå hintó discovereä  wheî 
playinç  thå  game®   Iô ió bù nï menaó exhaustivå noò ió iô meanô  tï  be®  
Reaä theí anä consideò thaô therå maù bå teî morå thingó tï thinë abouô foò 
each hint listed here.

    Establishinç á baså neaò á temperatå zonå wilì makå thå  transportatioî 
of food closer and faster.

    Reestablishinç  á  baså  ió helpfuì tï distributå  purchaseó  froí  thå 
trader.

    Once an item has been deleted it cannot be recovered.

    Bå  carefuì wheî abortinç actions®   Yoõ maù noô changå youò minä  oncå 
you have pressed the shift right arrow.

    Remeber that over loaded vehicles will not move.

    Iæ  á  transportatioî  actioî ió aborteä iî thå  middle¬  thå  vehicleó 
involveä  wilì  remaiî iî thå blocë wherå theù wherå theù  wherå  wheî  thå 
action was aborted.

    Alì oæ thå componentó foò productioî musô bå iî thå outeò mosô leveì iî 
the resource tree for the block prior to pressing F7.

    Refinerieó  requirå  á  hugå amounô oæ investmenô iî fueì  anä  people®  
This should be taken into account when weighing the advantages of refining.

    Iæ  minimaì exploratioî oæ á blocë ió done¬  somå subsurfacå  resourceó 
may be overlooked.
   
    Thå  ratå  oæ extractioî ió baseä oî thå  equipmenô  anä  thå 
deposiô  size®  Yoõ  maù  wanô  tï breaë uğ thå  deposiô  anä  dï 
multiplå extractionó tï speeä uğ thå process.

    You will probably want to develop only a portion of the block.

    Developinç farí lanä iî youò baså blocë oò anù otheò  heavilù    
populateä blocë woulä bå tï youò advantage.
.PAŠ.FO                                 Page A-#
.PN 1









                           APPENDIX A


                    Installation Instructions

INSTALLATION OF STARFALL:

SYSTEM REQUIREMENTS:

1.  IBM PC OR 100% Compatible
2.  640K RAM
3.  5 Megabyte hard drive
4.  1 floppy disk drive.
5.  RGB Color Monitor
6.  The ability to configure a 128K ramdisk.
7.  MS-DOS 2.1 or greater

Supplied with the STARFALL system are three diskettes:

STERFALL MAIN
STARFALL DATA
EXAMPLE WORLDS

Iô  ió suggesteä thaô thå useò  creatå á  directorù  specificallù 
foò  STARFALÌ  oî  thå  harä disk¬  iî ordeò  tï  avoiä  filenamå 
confusion¬  etc®   Iî ordeò tï dï this¬  booô yoõ harä disk¬  anä 
type:

MKDIR STARFALL

(Foò  morå  informatioî oî directorieó iî  thå  MS-DOÓ  operatinç 
system, please see your user's manual.)

Thå  firsô  steğ tï installinç thå systeí ió tï loaä  alì oæ  thå 
fileó ontï thå harä disk®   Thå followinç ió aî  examplå session¬ 
witè  thå  harä disë beinç drivå Cº   anä thå floppù drivå  beinç 
drive A:.  If these drives have different designationó oî 
youò  system¬  pleaså  substitutå thoså valueó  foò  Aº  anä  C:¬ 
respectively.
.PAŠ

(Booô uğ youò harä drive)

CD\STARFALL

(Put STARFALL MAIN disk in the floppy drive, A: )

Copy A:*.*

(Put STARFALL DATA disk in the floppy drive, when this complete.)

COPY A:*.*

(Puô  EXAMPLÅ  WORLDÓ disë iî thå floppù drivå wheî thió copù  ió 
complete.)


COPY A: *.*

INSTALLING STARFALL ONTO A RAMDISK:

Sincå thå detailó oæ ramdiskó varù froí computeò tï computer¬  nï 
preciså  detailó arå giveî here®   Foò details¬  pleaså seå  youò 
system owner's manual.

The minimum size for the ramdisk is 128K.

Afteò  thå  ramdisë  haó beeî configureä  intï  thå  system¬  thå 
STARFALÌ overlaù fileó neeä tï bå loadeä ontï it®   Thå followinç 
dialoguå assumeó thaô therå ió á harä disë locateä aô Cº witè alì 
oæ  thå  STARFALÌ  programó  anä  datá  iî  á  directorù   calleä 
\STARFALL®    Iô alsï assumeó thaô thå ramdisë ió nameä 'D:'®  Iæ 
theså drivå assignmentó arå differenô oî youò system¬  substitutå 
youò  harä  disë  drivå letteò foò C:¬  anä youò raí  disë  drivå 
designation letter for D: in the following dialogue.

(Boot up system)

(Configure 128K ramdisk (example uses D:))

D:

Copy C:\STARFALL\PLAYGAME.0??

Iî  ordeò tï inforí STARFALÌ wherå theså overlaù fileó  are¬  thå 
INSTALL.COM  program must be run.  In order to do this, type:
.PAŠ

INSTALL

INSTALÌ wilì asë foò thå drivå designatioî oæ thå overlaù  files®  
Typå  thå drivå letteò ¨ iî thå examplå above¬  iô woulä bå  D:)¬ 
witè  oò witè ouô thå colon¬  anä presó thå <RETURN¾  key®   Thió 
only needs to be done once for each installation of STARFALL.

GETTING STARTED

1.  Boot up your system.

2.  Install STARFALL, as described in Appendix A.

3.  Type 'STARFALL' and press <RETURN>.
